      "name": "Credentials",
      "description": {
        "content": "> Use these Connect API endpoints to get credentials for OAuth consumers of an external client app. Collections returns credentials for all consumers associated with an external client app. Resources returns the the key, secret, or both key and secret for a specific consumer.",
